imes as k/r/l/o, and the mode reported 3 per-column readers against 23 relation-level ones while OMITTING the licence. Fixed by unwrapping .element. Selftest 15/15 to 19/19, --check fresh at 94 builders, sppf_db --selftest 243/243 unchanged.}
