rected machinery at a tool that already works — after Ⓢ5 (already built and default-on, sql-F14) and Ⓢ6 (both offered framings refuted, sql-F16). ⚑ THE RESIDUE IS NOT ZERO: a stale line-number citation. The brief locates the sites at :983, :1025, :1252 and they have since moved, which is the cite-a-symbol-never-a-line rule from CLAUDE.md, observed inside a brief about this file.}
