the deliberate flagless case ABORTS THE WHOLE SUITE mid-run and schema.py --selftest --live exits 2 having run part of 221. sppf_db --selftest is unaffected (243/243 under the same env). So the ratchet's terminal state makes its own suite unrunnable, and the case's note anticipating 'the advisory-vs-refusal path would go uncovered' cannot be satisfied by a case that dies on the refusal. Zero SUBSTRATE_EXPLICIT_TENANT sites exist in schema_selftest/schema_rows/run_selftests.}
